  "src_rules_note": "Which rules read the SRC normalization (the tokenize-joined string runs of the property's own generators). Scoped per Ruling B 2026-09-17: NOT R3's T1/T2 numeral halves, because the generators embed the citation registry's own deliberately-kept dollar figures (DCI 7786ce5 records why the registry keeps them) and a $-anchored or bare-numeral scan over them would flood with figures that are correct where they sit. R3's T3 rank-claim half DOES read SRC, because 'the largest rebate' lived in _generate_service_pages.py CROSS_CONTEXT['attic'] and shipped to six pages from there. R7 half A (identifiers) also stays off SRC: the 2026-09-07 four-repo sweep measured DCI 62 / LGM 64 hits for the superseded print codes of which only NINE were live defects.",

