    "code_noun_markers_reason": "code_context_markers had become the blanket pardon f_pub used to be: naming ENERGY STAR anywhere in a sentence cleared any uncited statistic in it, through a filter whose stated purpose is CODE CONTEXT. 'ENERGY STAR homes differ, but our crews measure a 35% reduction in heating costs' was pardoned by it. The marker must now sit within 60 chars of the figure AND one of these nouns must be present, so the marker has to actually govern the number.",
